{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1512303-how-would-one-attain-a-spiritual-metamorphasis-exactly","id":1512303,"title":"How would one attain a Spiritual Metamorphasis exactly?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-05-21T14:30:59-07:00","id":1512303,"title":"How would one attain a Spiritual Metamorphasis exactly?","content":"In the &quot;DAV: Dark Ages Storytellers Companion&quot; it was shown that the Road of Metamorphasists has two minor paths: the Path of Flesh and the Path of Spirit. While it is clear how adherents of the Path of Flesh can progress on the Road of Metamorphosis, I'm more interested in what methods adherents of the Path of Spirit can use to advance within the road. I'm actually wondering why the writers would even include Path of Spirit as there are no published powers that I know of that would help an adherent alter their own soul.<br /> <br /> One could make the argument that necromancy might be useful, but from what I have seen, necromancy focuses primarily on commanding wraiths and zombies to do your bidding, not altering the practitioner's soul. Diablerie can help, but other than adding a few souls to the collection, increasing the chance of being taken over by one of your victims, developing a multi-personality disorder, and perhaps lowering your generation a bit, there doesn't seem to be much in the way of helping you attain a Spiritual Metamorphosis.<br /> <br /> I actually wrote up a discipline quite recently that functions as vicissitude for spiritual entities such as souls, elemental spirits, etc. One could use this discipline to alter their own soul and merge it with other spiritual entities. I don't really know if it would make it into a game though, as it feels more similar to a Theme from VTR than an actual discipline.<br /> <br /> What are your thoughts?\u200b\u200b","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}